<title>USA: Omnicare buys EBA Pharmacy and Sun Health.</title>
<headline>Omnicare buys EBA Pharmacy and Sun Health.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Omnicare Inc said on Tuesday that it bought EBA Pharmacy Inc and Sun Health Inc. The terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Omnicare said the two acquisitions would add $4 million in annualized revenues.</p>
<p>(( --New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
